# Testing & quality

Catalog: [TESTING_SCENARIOS.md](../../TESTING_SCENARIOS.md) · CI: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`

## Commands

```bash
pnpm run test:unit     # unit tests only (gate requirement)
pnpm test              # unit + integration
pnpm run test:integration
pnpm run lint
pnpm run build
npx tsc --project server/tsconfig.json
```

## Unit tests (required for new domain logic)

Place under `__tests__/unit/`. Cover:

- Zod schemas / validators
- Pure mappers, hour aggregation, date/period helpers
- Cache key / `delKeyFamily` / invalidate helpers
- Reporting transforms and permission helpers

Prefer extracting testable functions into `server/shared`, `server/modules/<domain>/`, or `lib/`.

When changing `server/utils/validation.ts`, update `__tests__/unit/validation.test.ts`.

## Test layout

```
__tests__/
  unit/           # required for new/changed domain logic
  integration/    # optional
  setup.ts
```

## CI

`.github/workflows/ci.yml` runs lint + **unit** Jest on PR/push. Keep that job green.

## Integration tests (optional)

- Mock DB at `pool.execute`; use supertest.
- Optional; not required for every change.

## Before PR

1. `pnpm run test:unit`
2. Manual smoke from [TESTING_SCENARIOS.md](../../TESTING_SCENARIOS.md) when the change affects user flows

## Do not

- Commit `.env` secrets.
- Skip unit tests for new pure logic in `server/modules` / `server/shared`.
- Block gates on expanding integration/e2e suites.
